#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`Collect2qBlocks`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.Collect2qBlocks)\n"
msgstr ""
"[`Collect2qBlocks`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.Collect2qBlocks)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`ConsolidateBlocks`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.ConsolidateBlocks)\n"
msgstr ""
"[`ConsolidateBlocks`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.ConsolidateBlocks)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`UnitarySynthesis`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.UnitarySynthesis)\n"
msgstr ""
"[`UnitarySynthesis`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.UnitarySynthesis)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`Optimize1qGateDecomposition`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.Optimize1qGatesDecomposition)\n"
msgstr ""
"[`Optimize1qGateDecomposition`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.Optimize1qGatesDecomposition)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[`CommutativeCancellation`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.CommutativeCancellation)\n"
msgstr ""
"[`CommutativeCancellation`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.CommutativeCancellation)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, this stage also executes a few final checks to make sure that "
"all instructions in the circuit are composed of the basis gates available on"
" the target backend.\n"
msgstr ""
"De plus, cette étape exécute également quelques vérifications finales pour "
"s'assurer que toutes les instructions du circuit sont composées des portes "
"de base disponibles sur le backend cible.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The example below using a GHZ state demonstrates the effects of different "
"optimization level settings on circuit depth and gate count.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'exemple ci-dessous utilisant un état GHZ illustre les effets des "
"différents niveaux d'optimisation sur la profondeur du circuit et le nombre "
"de portes.\n"

